{"ref":"BDB, אָיֹם","hw":"אָיֹם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָיֹם</span></big>  <strong>adj. terrible, dreadful</strong>—<em>terrible</em>, of Chaldeans <span dir=\"rtl\">אָיֹם וְנוֹרָא הוּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.7\">Hb 1:7</a>; of dignified woman, <em>awe-inspiring</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲיֻמָּה כַּנִּדְגָלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.4\">Ct 6:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 6:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.6.10\">10</a>.","next":"BDB, אֵימָה","prev":"BDB, אים"}